#: 64065a97b8f84dcfac84bcadacb6d856
msgid ""
"The new class is imported from the `multidimensional` submodule during "
"the migration. From version 0.20.0 onwards, the new class is imported "
"from the root `pymc_marketing.mmm.MMM` module."
msgstr ""
"La nueva clase se importa desde el submódulo `multidimensional` durante la "
"migración. A partir de la versión 0.20.0, la nueva clase se importa desde el"
" módulo raíz `pymc_marketing.mmm.MMM`."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_migration_guide.ipynb:30002
#: e18e8782c6484981ad980a2fa7204f57
msgid "Methods Removed Without 1-to-1 Replacement"
msgstr "Métodos eliminados sin reemplazo 1 a 1"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_migration_guide.ipynb:30004
#: 36d3fc3b2ffc4a2d953ca4b024659915
msgid ""
"The old `mmm.MMM` API had helper methods that are no longer available "
"directly on the new multidimensional `MMM` class."
msgstr ""
"La antigua API `mmm.MMM` tenía métodos auxiliares que ya no están "
"disponibles directamente en la nueva clase `MMM` multidimensional."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_migration_guide.ipynb:30006
#: d5adece7942c4ea0b051106b7245631c
msgid ""
"`compute_channel_contribution_original_scale` -> call "
"`mmm.add_original_scale_contribution_variable(var=[\"channel_contribution\"])`"
" and read `mmm.idata.posterior[\"channel_contribution_original_scale\"]`."
msgstr ""
"`compute_channel_contribution_original_scale` -> llame a "
"`mmm.add_original_scale_contribution_variable(var=[\"channel_contribution\"])`"
" y lea `mmm.idata.posterior[\"channel_contribution_original_scale\"]`."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_migration_guide.ipynb:30007
#: 4a81f9448d254488afa733e13a570839
msgid ""
"`get_channel_contribution_share_samples` -> no dedicated public data "
"accessor; use `mmm.plot.channel_contribution_share_hdi()` for "
"visualization, or compute shares manually from `channel_contribution` "
"posterior samples."
msgstr ""
"`get_channel_contribution_share_samples` -> no hay un acceso público "
"dedicado a los datos; use `mmm.plot.channel_contribution_share_hdi()` para "
"la visualización, o calcule las proporciones manualmente a partir de las "
"muestras posteriores de `channel_contribution`."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_migration_guide.ipynb:30008
#: c75a1446d875496dbd5420f95b32fe30
msgid ""
"`get_ts_contribution_posterior` -> no dedicated method on the new `MMM`. "
"Access the time-series of channel contributions directly via "
"`mmm.idata.posterior[\"channel_contribution\"]`. For original-scale "
"values, first call "
"`mmm.add_original_scale_contribution_variable(var=[\"channel_contribution\"])`"
" and then read "
"`mmm.idata.posterior[\"channel_contribution_original_scale\"]`."
msgstr ""
"`get_ts_contribution_posterior` -> no hay un método dedicado en la nueva "
"`MMM`. Acceda a la serie temporal de las contribuciones de los canales "
"directamente mediante `mmm.idata.posterior[\"channel_contribution\"]`. Para "
"obtener valores en la escala original, llame primero a "
"`mmm.add_original_scale_contribution_variable(var=[\"channel_contribution\"])`"
" y luego lea `mmm.idata.posterior[\"channel_contribution_original_scale\"]`."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_migration_guide.ipynb:30009
#: d899bf3ccc304a8eb448561774052121
msgid ""
"`new_spend_contributions` / `plot_new_spend_contributions` -> wrap the "
"model with `BudgetOptimizerWrapper` and call its "
"`sample_response_distribution(...)` method on the wrapper (not on `MMM`)."
" The API and output format differ from the old helpers:"
msgstr ""
"`new_spend_contributions` / `plot_new_spend_contributions` -> envuelva el "
"modelo con `BudgetOptimizerWrapper` y llame a su método "
"`sample_response_distribution(...)` en el wrapper (no en `MMM`). La API y el"
" formato de salida difieren de los antiguos métodos auxiliares:"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_migration_guide.ipynb:30022
#: 41a7d1d4b31b46aa9a88debd826bfc9d
msgid ""
"`plot_grouped_contribution_breakdown_over_time` -> no built-in stacked-"
"area + group-merging plot on the new `MMM`. The closest replacements are "
"`mmm.plot.contributions_over_time(...)` (line plot) and "
"`mmm.plot.waterfall_components_decomposition(...)` (single-snapshot bar)."
" For stacked-area visuals or custom channel groupings, build the figure "
"manually by indexing `mmm.idata.posterior[\"channel_contribution\"]` and "
"aggregating channels into groups before plotting."
msgstr ""
"`plot_grouped_contribution_breakdown_over_time` -> no hay un gráfico "
"integrado de área apilada con agrupación de componentes en la nueva `MMM`. "
"Los reemplazos más cercanos son `mmm.plot.contributions_over_time(...)` "
"(gráfico de líneas) y `mmm.plot.waterfall_components_decomposition(...)` "
"(gráfico de barras de un único instante). Para visualizaciones de área "
"apilada o agrupaciones personalizadas de canales, construya la figura "
"manualmente indexando `mmm.idata.posterior[\"channel_contribution\"]` y "
"agregando los canales en grupos antes de trazar el gráfico."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_migration_guide.ipynb:30023
#: b6a4b6cdeb624b57a4ce719bf98d0a8d
msgid ""
"`format_recovered_transformation_parameters` -> removed, no direct "
"replacement."
msgstr ""
"`format_recovered_transformation_parameters` -> eliminado, sin reemplazo "
"directo."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_migration_guide.ipynb:30024
#: d3ca4c28ea644bbeb2f8186564400a29
msgid ""
"`BaseValidateMMM` and `MMMModelBuilder` were removed from the public "
"migration path; external subclasses should migrate to "
"`multidimensional.MMM` composition/integration patterns."
msgstr ""
"`BaseValidateMMM` y `MMMModelBuilder` se eliminaron de la ruta pública de "
"migración; las subclases externas deberían migrar a los patrones de "
"composición/integración de `multidimensional.MMM`."

